### Feature Client — CRUD (SIN AUTH)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@id = 1

### GET ALL
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/clientes

### GET ONE
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/clientes/{{id}}

### CREATE
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/clientes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tipo_documento": "CC",
  "numero_documento": "1234567890",
  "nombre": "Ana Pérez",
  "telefono": "3001234567",
  "email": "ana.perez@example.com"
}

### UPDATE (PUT) — reemplazo completo
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/clientes/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tipo_documento": "CC",
  "numero_documento": "1234567890",
  "nombre": "Ana Pérez Actualizada",
  "telefono": "3009876543",
  "email": "ana.perez@example.com"
}

### UPDATE (PATCH) — parcial
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/clientes/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "telefono": "3011112233"
}

### DELETE lógico (is_active = false)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/clientes/{{id}}/deactivate

### DELETE físico
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/clientes/{{id}}
